2.   Precinct Data And GIS Maps

# Precinct Data and GIS Maps

The Registrar of Voters' Office (ROV) provides precinct boundary data in multiple digital formats to support public access.

There are several ways to obtain the precinct boundary data:

**Option 1: Download Individual Precinct Maps (PDF)**

To obtain a PDF map of a specific precinct, use the link below. Through the linked portal, you may:

*   Search using any residential address located within the precinct.
*   Search for precincts contained within a selected district.
*   Search by entering a specific precinct number.

These PDF maps are available for immediate download at no cost.

[Download Precinct Maps](https://rovservices.sccgov.org/Home/IndexPost?selected=pm&distance=0&selectedLanguageId=22)

**Option 2: Request Countywide Precinct Boundary (GIS shapefile)**

To obtain the official countywide precinct boundary data for Santa Clara County in GIS shapefile format, please submit the Request Form below. A downloadable ZIP file will be emailed to you within two business days at no cost.

**Option 3: Request District-Specific Precinct Boundary (GIS shapefile)**

To obtain precinct boundary data for a specific district, a data extraction service fee of $176 applies, please follow these steps:

*   Submit the Request Form below.
*   Complete your payment through the [O](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[nline](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems")[P](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[ayment](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems")[P](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[ortal](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems").
*   A downloadable ZIP file will be emailed to you within two business days.

**Option 4: Purchase a Customized Precinct Map**

To obtain a customized precinct map, please follow these steps:

*   Submit the Request Form below.
*   Review the [Fees Schedule](https://vote.santaclaracounty.gov/fees-schedule#D.Precinct%20Maps) (Section D: Precinct Maps).
*   Pay the standard setup fee of $150 for each district map, plus any applicable printing fees.
*   Complete your payment through the [O](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[nline](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems")[P](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[ayment](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems")[P](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems)[ortal](https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems "https://paydirect.link2gov.com/SCVoterAndElectionFees/ItemSelection/SelectItems").
*   You will receive a notification when your map is ready for pickup.

For any other GIS‑related questions or data needs, please contact the ROV’s Geographic Information System (GIS) Division at **ROV-GIS@rov.sccgov.org**.

Bob Nguyen  
Phone: (408) 282-3037  
Email: Bob.Nguyen@rov.sccgov.org

